The variables of the table above,\: as bare names (\fBroute\fR,\: \fBupstream\fR and \fBtenant\fR are empty in \fBroutes[].\:when\fR,\: which runs before the route is chosen)
T}
T{
\fBheader("Name")\fR,\: \fBcookie("name")\fR,\: \fBquery("name")\fR,\: \fBcapture("name")\fR
T}	T{
A request header (case insensitive,\: first value),\: cookie,\: query parameter or regular expression group by name or number;\: empty when absent
T}
T{
\fBhas_\:header("Name")\fR,\: \fBhas_\:cookie("name")\fR,\: \fBhas_\:query("name")\fR
T}	T{
Presence,\: also of an empty value
T}
T{
\fBcert("field")\fR
T}	T{
A client certificate field as in the variable table (\fBcert("cn") =\:=\: "billing\-\:batch"\fR,\: \fBcert("fingerprint") in [.\:.\:.\:]\fR);\: empty without a client certificate
T}
T{
\fBx in ["a",\: "b"]\fR,\: \fBx not in [.\:.\:.\:]\fR
T}	T{
Membership in a list of literals
T}
T{
\fBclient_\:ip in cidr("10.\:0.\:0.\:0/\:8",\: "2001:\:db8:\::\:/\:32",\: "203.\:0.\:113.\:7")\fR
T}	T{
Address containment in prefixes or single addresses;\: a value that is not an address is never contained
T}
T{
\fBx matches "pattern"\fR,\: \fBmatches(x,\: "pattern")\fR
T}	T{
RE2 match anywhere in the value;\: anchor with \fB^\fR and \fB$\fR for the whole value. Patterns are literals,\: compiled at load
T}
T{
\fBstarts_\:with(x,\: "p")\fR,\: \fBends_\:with(x,\: "s")\fR,\: \fBcontains(x,\: "part")\fR
T}	T{
Substring tests
T}
T{
\fBlower(x)\fR,\: \fBupper(x)\fR,\: \fBtrim(x)\fR,\: \fBlen(x)\fR
T}	T{
Case folding,\: whitespace trimming and byte length
T}
.TE
.PP
Examples: \fBmethod in ["GET", "HEAD"] and hour >= 22 or hour < 6\fR (read\-only traffic in the night window), \fBcountry in ["SE", "NO", "DK"] && not has_cookie("consent")\fR, \fBpath matches "^/api/v[0\-9]+/" && header("Content\-Length") > 1048576\fR, \fBcapture("id") != "" && ja4 == ""\fR.
