.SH "bans"
.PP
Present means enabled. Bans apply before routing; banned peers are closed at accept when \fBaction\fR is \fBdrop\fR, and answered 403 when the client address comes from a trusted proxy chain or \fBaction\fR is \fBreject\fR.
.PP
