.SH "cluster"
.PP
Present means enabled. Nodes exchange rate limit consumption and ban changes over mutual TLS (AMR\-009, AMR\-021). Every node listens and dials every peer; there is no leader. Enabling or disabling the section, and changing \fBlisten\fR, \fBnode_id\fR or \fBtls\fR, require a restart. Peers, intervals and sharing flags reload.
.PP
.TS
